Tumours of the renal pelvis and ureter. Observations in 170 patients</article-title><source>Br J Urol</source><year>1988</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>277</fpage><lpage>283</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3289673</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Derby</surname><given-names>LE</given-names></name><name><surname>Jick</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acetaminophen and renal and bladder cancer</article-title><source>Epidemiology</source><year>1996</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>358</fpage><lpage>362</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8793360</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00001648-199607000-00004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Friis</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Nielsen</surname><given-names>GL</given-names></name><name><surname>Mellemkjaer</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>McLaughlin</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Thulstrup</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Blot</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lipworth</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Vilstrup</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Olsen</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cancer risk in persons receiving prescriptions for paracetamol: a Danish cohort study</article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><year>2002</year><volume>97</volume><fpage>96</fpage><lpage>101</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11774249</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/ijc.1581</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kaye</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Myers</surn